      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Rendezvous_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When I first read the prophecy that Shadow, Chaos and War were coming to Zanadu I was terrified. I resolved to save my kingdom however I could.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_108.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254523,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Rendezvous_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "At first I sought aid from the Arcanum in deciphering the prophecy - I tried to leave Empyrea on Coleridge's ship, only to be trapped on Aeriel.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254523,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Rendezvous_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yet here I am: at the very place and hour I am needed, I will drive back this darkness. All thanks to you. I am in your debt, Wizard.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_110.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254523,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Rendezvous_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Once they defeat their pursuers, Pork and the others will meet us inside the Palace. Now we must take full advantage of their diversion. Away!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_111.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254523,
